SUMMARY:Living History Festival at Colonial Fort Conde
DESCRIPTION:Colonial Fort Conde in downtown Mobile marks the 50th annivers
 ary of its reconstruction with a day of 18th century demonstrations. Hist
 orical groups from across the region show musket firing\, military drills
  and colonial skills\, and explain how people handled laundry\, money and
  hygiene. The festival also looks at the foods and social life of Europea
 n and Indigenous colonial communities.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Mobile & Baldw
 in County\nTimes: Saturday 11/14 · 10:00 AM to 3:30 PM\nChecked against 
 the venue's own page on 2026-10-28\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/e
 v-fort-conde-living-history-festival-1114.html
